      <h2 id="localH">Built for Houston rain.<br>Designed around your yard.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Flat ground, slow-draining clay and heavy Gulf Coast rain can leave water with nowhere to go. We look at the whole path, from the roof and side yard to the street or drainage outlet.</p>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>Clay soil &amp; standing water</b><span>Give trapped water a route away from the lawn and slab.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>Flat lots &amp; changing grades</b><span>Account for your patio, nearby lots and the height of the street.</span></div></li>
        <li><span class="check"><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg></span><div><b>Lot drainage &amp; bayou flooding</b><span>Understand which water a yard system can manage, and when the risk extends beyond your lot.</span></div></li>
